<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 300 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 300 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 300 million zlotys worth of 273-day NBP-bills after Polish banks bid for 383 million zlotys, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The minimum price at the auction was 86.86 and the average yield was 19.93 percent, up 0.03 point from the last 273-day NBP-bill sale on September 24.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
